---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: withdrawExcessInvestedCapital(merkleProof, acceptedAmount)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_results: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_results --> q_check_claimed: saleResultsPublished == true
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not published
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: investorPosition[investor].hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: excess already claimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_excess: MerkleProof.verify(merkleProof, acceptedCapitalRoot, leaf(investor, acceptedAmount))
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excessAmount = investorPosition[investor].investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_set_claimed: excessAmount > 0
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: no excess to claim
    q_set_claimed --> q_transfer: investorPosition[investor].hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> q_emit: bidToken.transfer(investor, excessAmount)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(investor, excessAmount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: excess = investedCapital - acceptedCapital (never negative due to Merkle proof)
        INV-002: hasClaimedExcess prevents double-claim
        INV-003: Merkle proof ensures acceptedAmount is backend-determined allocation
    end note
